{"id":"acerca","lemma":"acerca","pos":"adv","rank":377,"glosses":["only used in acerca de (“about; concerning”)"],"ipa":"/aˈθeɾka/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-acerca.wav","examples":[{"text":"La primavera se acerca.","en":"Spring is coming.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442883"},{"text":"Se acerca el verano.","en":"Summer is coming.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636798"},{"text":"El invierno se acerca.","en":"Winter is coming.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461515"},{"text":"Hablemos acerca del problema.","en":"Let's talk about the problem.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600212"},{"text":"Él mintió acerca de eso.","en":"He lied about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636925"}]}